jenkins  2018/08/13 17:24:48

     ∇ r←isolate.RPCServer.AllowRemoteAccess filters;i
[1]   ⍝ By default, RPCServer will only accept connections from the local machine
[2]   ⍝ /// validation?
[3]   
[4]   r←filters
[5]   
[6]   :If 0=⍴allowremote←r
[7]   Log'Local access only'
[8]   :Else
[9]   Log'Remote access allowed for ',,⍕filters
[10]   :EndIf
     ∇

jenkins  2018/08/13 17:24:48

     ∇ isolate.RPCServer.Boot;name;port;certfile;keyfile;sslflags;num;secure;load;l;folder;z;autoshut;quiet;allowremote;commasep;localaddrs
[1]   ⍝ Bootstrap an RPC-Server using the following command line parameters
[2]   ⍝ -Port=nnnn
[3]   ⍝ -Load=.dyalog files to load before start
[4]   ⍝ -AllowRemote=filter1,filter2,filter3
[5]   ⍝ SSL Options
[6]   ⍝ -CertFile=CertFile
[7]   ⍝ -KeyFile=KeyFile
[8]   ⍝ -SSLFlags=flags
[9]   ⍝ /// Could be extended with
[10]   ⍝ -Config=name of a configuration file
[11]   ⍝ -ClientAddr=limit to connections from given site
[12]  
[13]   folder←{(1-⌊/(⌽⍵)⍳'/\')↓⍵}⎕WSID
[14]   num←{⊃2⊃⎕VFI ⍵}
[15]   sslflags←32+64 ⍝ Accept without Validating, RequestClientCertificate
[16]  
[17]   name←'RPCSRV'
[18]   port←num GetEnv'Port'
[19]   autoshut←num GetEnv'AutoShut' ⍝ Shut down if 1st connection is lost
[20]   quiet←num GetEnv'Quiet'       ⍝ Suppress diagnostic session output
[21]   allowremote←GetEnv'AllowRemote' ⍝ Remote access
[22]   allowremote←(0≠≢allowremote)/{1↓¨(⍵=',')⊂⍵}',',allowremote
[23]  
[24]   z←##.DRC.Init''
[25]   localaddrs←⊃⍪/{0::0 3⍴⊂⍬ ⋄ DNSLookup ⍵}¨'' 'localhost' ⍝ Find all local addresses
